    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing. i'm \"alive\" but i'm just... existing in a shell. the version of me that people liked, the person who had a purpose and a career and actually felt like a human being... they're gone. i'm just a walking punchline now. how am i supposed to keep pretending to be a person when the whole world has already decided who i am?",
