    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rewrite it? how? there's no paper left to write on. everything i touch is ruined. it's not just a bad reputation, it's like i've been erased. i feel like a ghost haunting my own life. sometimes i think it would be more honest if i actually was gone, instead of just pretending i still exist when everyone already treats me like i'm invisible anyway.",
